    *MINIKUBE In Detailed:--

*ALL-IN-ONE SINGLE NODE INSTALLATION:--											- With all-in-one, all the master and worker components are installed on a single node,
 This is very useful for learning, development and testing, This type should not be used 
 in production minikube is one such example.

*SINGLE-NODE ETCD, SINGLE-MASTER AND MULTU-WORKER INSTALLATION:--
- In this setup , we have a single master node which also runs a single-node etcd instance 
  multiple worker nodes are connected to the master node.


*SINGLE-NODE ETCD, MULTI MASTER AND MULTI-WORKER INSTALLATION:--

*In this setup , we have multiple master nodes which works in an HA mode, but we have a 
 single-node etcd instance, Multiple worker nodes are connceted to the master node.

